{"title":"2011 AMC 12A Problems/Problem 8","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Problem\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Problem</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Solution_1\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 1</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Solution_2\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 2</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#Solution_3_(the_tedious_one)\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 3 (the tedious one)</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-5\"><a href=\"#Solution_4_(the_cheap_one)\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">5</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 4 (the cheap one)</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-6\"><a href=\"#Solution_5\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">6</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 5</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-7\"><a href=\"#Solution_6\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">7</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 6</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-8\"><a href=\"#Note\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">8</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Note</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-9\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">9</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-10\"><a href=\"#Podcast_Solution\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">10</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Podcast Solution</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-11\"><a href=\"#See_also\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">11</span> <span class=\"toctext\">See also</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2011_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_8&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>In the eight term sequence <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/1/9/019e9892786e493964e145e7c5cf7b700314e53b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$A$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"15\" height=\"14\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/f/5/ff5fb3d775862e2123b007eb4373ff6cc1a34d4e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$B$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"17\" height=\"14\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/3/3/c3355896da590fc491a10150a50416687626d7cc.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$C$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"16\" height=\"14\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/f/f/9ffb448918db29f2a72f8f87f421b3b3cad18f95.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$D$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"17\" height=\"14\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/a/2/fa2fa899f0afb05d6837885523503a2d4df434f9.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$E$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"16\" height=\"14\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/0/5/a055f405829e64a3b70253ab67cb45ed6ed5bb29.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$F$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"16\" height=\"14\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/e/2/6e28ce12d49d39f160d5a0ef54077fc98e4b9d2b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$G$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"16\" height=\"14\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/1/9/b1902d279ba37d60bdce4e0e987b7cd19d48974e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$H$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"18\" height=\"14\" />, the value of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/3/3/c3355896da590fc491a10150a50416687626d7cc.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$C$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"16\" height=\"14\" /> is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/9/0/79069377f91364c2f87a64e5f9f562a091c8a6c1.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$5$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> and the sum of any three consecutive terms is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/5/1/651ba418a810d971dbc8a326d49a71fe1541fae0.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$30$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" />. What is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/d/6/8d685d06fe51677d4e21bb0dfdc5f674767df7c5.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$A+H$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"52\" height=\"14\" />?\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/a/5/fa585b0f2b7a3d68727e706d92160b7af26fe0fd.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textbf{(A)}\\ 17 \\qquad \\textbf{(B)}\\ 18 \\qquad \\textbf{(C)}\\ 25 \\qquad \\textbf{(D)}\\ 26 \\qquad \\textbf{(E)}\\ 43$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"394\" height=\"17\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_1\">Solution 1</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2011_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_8&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 1\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Let <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/a/e/cae669897108d7198614e5dfacf7f54dbc2c734b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$A=x$\" width=\"48\" height=\"13\" />. Then from <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/3/c/43cee4d874df05794dd0fdab1f96843da8e8f926.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$A+B+C=30$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"129\" height=\"14\" />, we find that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/1/e/01eab809ed4d7509f691db4e2b727c2baf4ac6f8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$B=25-x$\" width=\"89\" height=\"12\" />. From <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/4/e/44ea608e6e494c690bc61195ef286ea82118a655.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$B+C+D=30$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"130\" height=\"14\" />, we then get that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/2/3/2236e2d144171d3a8280308db5012bea5d1f1605.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$D=x$\" width=\"50\" height=\"12\" />. Continuing this pattern, we find <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/c/6/9c67abfce13bdee8edf3ac3970566da3aba5620d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$E=25-x$\" width=\"89\" height=\"12\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/b/9/5b96df75753b23a179f96a9857176c54bda92366.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$F=5$\" width=\"47\" height=\"12\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/b/4/9b45a445ac00624cb098d9b4d228f8cb75c7bd7f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$G=x$\" width=\"48\" height=\"12\" />, and finally <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/6/c/06c227aebf57f302a1e9f1b48e9aa3f312c56b75.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$H=25-x$\" width=\"91\" height=\"12\" />. So <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/1/a/c1a509c66193c1a7861a41f40baf33914a11d5d0.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$A+H=x+25-x=25 \\rightarrow \\boxed{\\textbf{C}}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"256\" height=\"23\" />\n</p><p><br />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_2\">Solution 2</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2011_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_8&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 2\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Given that the sum of 3 consecutive terms is 30, we have\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/4/7/b473fec293dd3419cf51f2145f4f7c662b7824ab.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(A+B+C)+(C+D+E)+(F+G+H)=90$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"394\" height=\"18\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/4/4/74441b98e57a51aec81ac9628ca01ab37a8f4ddc.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(B+C+D)+(E+F+G)=60$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"268\" height=\"18\" />\n</p><p>It follows that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/e/4/be4358dbdf07f14efd09650e133c62954cd38f99.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$A+B+C+D+E+F+G+H=85$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"315\" height=\"14\" /> because <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/a/b/eab80c89c81d07db002b2e6a2b95b61e8726ab7e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$C=5$\" width=\"47\" height=\"12\" />.\n</p><p>Subtracting, we have that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/4/8/44869544e34d52f57c61cb6ef6cf5b9fa0017190.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$A+H=25\\rightarrow \\boxed{\\textbf{C}}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"148\" height=\"23\" />.\n</p><p><br />\n</p>\n<h2><span id=\"Solution_3_.28the_tedious_one.29\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_3_(the_tedious_one)\">Solution 3 (the tedious one)</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2011_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_8&amp;action=edit&amp;section=4\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 3 (the tedious one)\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>From the given information, we can deduce the following equations:\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/f/b/0fb8fc46baeedb5dde5ef7330868d79c47dc6b63.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$A+B=25, B+D=25, D+E=25, D+E+F=30, E+F+G =30$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"575\" height=\"16\" />, and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/0/8/108406e3d39e3333beb9bbf3be86676348670e6d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$F+G+H=30$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"134\" height=\"16\" />.\n</p><p>We can then cleverly manipulate the equations above by adding and subtracting them to be left with the answer.\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/8/7/387a7edc8dc28f2319b710484bc597a8949dc55e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(A+B)-(B+D)=25-25 \\implies (A-D)=0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"384\" height=\"18\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/a/f/0afc616acffb4297315cf036a197f4f002fd31a3.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(A-D)+(D+E)=0+25 \\implies (A+E)=25$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"383\" height=\"18\" /> \n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/6/7/c674fc6926494a344953c5d8cc0bd39e16b38151.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(A+E)-(E+F+G)=25-30 \\implies (A-F-G)=-5$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"468\" height=\"18\" /> (Notice how we don't use <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/2/7/f27b510fc1e2f4869e09b1a95f5344f35b4dbfbb.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$D+E+F=30$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"130\" height=\"14\" />)\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/2/4/b24ae46387e88cf40636ccda6cdb8e740e998ef7.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(A-F-G)+(F+G+H)=-5+30 \\implies (A+H)=25$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"472\" height=\"18\" />\n</p><p>Therefore, we have <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/d/9/0d989704116c8bdc4b903f48682e4d075e643dbf.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$A+H=25 \\rightarrow \\boxed{\\textbf{C}}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"148\" height=\"23\" />\n</p><p>~JinhoK\n</p>\n<h2><span id=\"Solution_4_.28the_cheap_one.29\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_4_(the_cheap_one)\">Solution 4 (the cheap one)</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2011_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_8&amp;action=edit&amp;section=5\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 4 (the cheap one)\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Since all of the answer choices are constants, it shouldn't matter what we pick <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/1/9/019e9892786e493964e145e7c5cf7b700314e53b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$A$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"15\" height=\"14\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/f/5/ff5fb3d775862e2123b007eb4373ff6cc1a34d4e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$B$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"17\" height=\"14\" /> to be, so let <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/5/1/2518971254f7f549537aa43063c69dd9fcc9c5f8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$A = 20$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"58\" height=\"14\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/2/b/22baac45709f59068286eec82ab9a4a82101582d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$B = 5$\" width=\"47\" height=\"12\" />. Then <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/b/1/8b1f9216430822ac09a5c31dacfc43204e823972.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$D = 30 - B -C = 20$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"176\" height=\"16\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/5/1/b51ad9f7eab26858f84d1ccb20e4d0b609449ceb.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$E = 30 - D - C = 5$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"166\" height=\"16\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/e/a/8ea6d6e4e673663a9245ba9cdb96c78a8ce56e64.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$F = 30 - D - E =5$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"166\" height=\"16\" />, and so on until we get <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/5/6/1566530dea088969414de08918f643889ffb8273.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$H = 5$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"52\" height=\"14\" />. Thus <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/1/f/e1f1781e9c9a660299babfa94a97bcb10412078a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$A + H = \\boxed{\\mathbf{(C)}25}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -11px\" width=\"137\" height=\"32\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_5\">Solution 5</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2011_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_8&amp;action=edit&amp;section=6\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 5\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Notice that the period of the sequence is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/c/d/7cde695f2e4542fd01f860a89189f47a27143b66.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$3$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> as given. (If this isn't clear we can show an example: <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/5/1/b511c7104cb0d7d3d1acb11635d323aa04c213b3.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$A+B+C=B+C=D$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"204\" height=\"16\" /> <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/6/e/a6ec0db174f3b705df19623976bf4b88ff502f3a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\Leftrightarrow$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"9\" /> <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/6/0/160bf1d3037daacf022becc3935d530ab8943e82.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$A=D$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"55\" height=\"14\" />). Then <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/6/0/160bf1d3037daacf022becc3935d530ab8943e82.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$A=D$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"55\" height=\"14\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/f/6/bf66ca94d818488bcdcd87cd3b91b424a07e70f9.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$H=B$\" width=\"55\" height=\"12\" />, so <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/4/0/04076a1c1f6259445aed09ad5c5cb96275a9852a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$A+H=D+B=D+B+C-C=30-5=\\boxed{\\textbf{(C)}\\;25}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -11px\" width=\"442\" height=\"30\" />.\n</p><p>~eevee9406\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_6\">Solution 6</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2011_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_8&amp;action=edit&amp;section=7\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 6\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Since the period of the sequence is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/c/d/7cde695f2e4542fd01f860a89189f47a27143b66.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$3$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/3/0/d30c799a2a0eac2fd92194cbbf62e3fb29c96c88.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[A=D=G, B=E=H, C=F\\]\" width=\"253\" height=\"16\" />\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/3/c/43cee4d874df05794dd0fdab1f96843da8e8f926.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$A+B+C=30$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"129\" height=\"14\" /> because any three consecutive terms sum to <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/5/1/651ba418a810d971dbc8a326d49a71fe1541fae0.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$30$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" />.\nSince <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/a/b/eab80c89c81d07db002b2e6a2b95b61e8726ab7e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$C=5$\" width=\"47\" height=\"12\" /> <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/b/c/fbc62ba05af5b32b3b8df972527abbd33955f5fc.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[A+B=25\\]\" width=\"91\" height=\"14\" />\nSince <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/a/e/6ae8b47522f061e594abbf051f86195d4c91a063.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$B=H$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"57\" height=\"14\" /> <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/7/f/17f4849ca7a77388a50a6e3ba7b321ca6bdf196f.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[A+B=A+H=\\fbox{(C) 25}\\]\" width=\"209\" height=\"28\" />\n</p><p>~sid2012 <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external autonumber\" href=\"https://artofproblemsolving.com/wiki/index.php/User:Sid2012\">[1]</a>\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Note\">Note</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2011_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_8&amp;action=edit&amp;section=8\" title=\"Edit section: Note\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Something useful to shorten a lot of the solutions above is to notice <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/a/3/3a3bd0488f618778430a8d6980ac2bb324be9640.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[5 + D + E = D + E + F\\]\" width=\"196\" height=\"14\" /> so F = 5\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_Solution\">Video Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2011_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_8&amp;action=edit&amp;section=9\" title=\"Edit section: Video Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=6tlqpAcmbz4\">https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=6tlqpAcmbz4</a>\n~Shreyas S\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Podcast_Solution\">Podcast Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2011_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_8&amp;action=edit&amp;section=10\" title=\"Edit section: Podcast Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://www.buzzsprout.com/56982/episodes/383730\">https://www.buzzsprout.com/56982/episodes/383730</a> (Episode starts with a solution to this question)\n—<a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=User:Wescarroll&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"User:Wescarroll (page does not exist)\">wescarroll</a>\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_also\">See also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2011_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_8&amp;action=edit&amp;section=11\" title=\"Edit section: See also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center